OL,3,AFrench police arrest 135 people, says
OL,4,Aminister, as protests take place across
OL,5,Acountry
OL,6,
OL,7,FPolice in Paris seize weapons and gas
OL,8,Fmasks in a crackdown as mass protests
OL,9,Fget under way in France
OL,11,FThe interior minister says that 135
OL,12,Fpeople have been arrested across the
OL,13,Fcountry as of 13:00 local time (12:00
OL,14,FBST)
OL,16,FShopfronts are boarded up, some tourist
OL,17,Fspots are shut and the capital has
OL,18,Fclosed a number of metro stations
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
